              "level": 0,
              "text": "painful with symmetric deficits; survey",
              "pdf_page": 612,
              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Keep recumbent patients on padded surface; radiography, MRI, CT, and/or myelography turn frequently to prevent pressure sores. help confirm the diagnosis.",
