              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Assist and encourage patients to ambulate",
              "pdf_page": 612,
              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Intra- and extramedullary hemorrhage as soon as possible. secondary to coagulopathy (e.g., anticoagulant",
              "pdf_page": 612,
              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Assist bladder emptying (catheterize or rodenticide ingestion, thrombocytopenia, or express) several times daily if needed. disseminated intravascular coagulation)—rule",
