              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Physical rehabilitation therapy may improve out by examining for underlying causes of recovery and reduce residual neurologic hemorrhage, performing platelet count, and deficits. determining blood clotting times.",
              "pdf_page": 612,
              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Sling or harness support for assisted",
              "pdf_page": 612,
              "printed_page": 530,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
